# Credits & Third-Party Licenses

Domovoy relies on several open-source libraries. We are grateful to the authors and contributors of these projects.

---

## Table of Third-Party Dependencies

| Library | License | Repository | Purpose in Domovoy |
|---|---|---|---|
| **GoogleTest** | BSD 3-Clause | https://github.com/google/googletest | Unit and integration testing framework |
| **Google Benchmark** | Apache License 2.0 | https://github.com/google/benchmark | Microbenchmarking suite |
| **nlohmann/json** | MIT License | https://github.com/nlohmann/json | JSON serialization for telemetry reports |
| **cpptrace** | MIT License | https://github.com/jeremy-rifkin/cpptrace | Cross-platform backtrace capture and symbolization |
| **Microsoft Detours** | MIT License | https://github.com/microsoft/Detours | Windows Win32 API interposition for IO monitoring |
| **libdwarf** | LGPL 2.1 / BSD | https://github.com/davea42/libdwarf-code | DWARF debug symbol resolution (used by cpptrace) |
| **zstd** | BSD 3-Clause / GPLv2 | https://github.com/facebook/zstd | Compression support for DWARF sections (used by libdwarf) |

